# Nextcloud AIO Docker Environment Variables

# AIO Dashboard Port
AIO_PORT=8080

# Apache Configuration (for reverse proxy setups)
APACHE_PORT=11000
APACHE_IP_BINDING=0.0.0.0

# Limits
UPLOAD_LIMIT=10G
MEMORY_LIMIT=1024M

# Timezone
TZ=America/New_York

# Architecture Notes
# ==================
# Nextcloud AIO uses a "mastercontainer" pattern:
# - This container spawns and manages sibling containers
# - Database, Redis, Apache, and optional services are created automatically
# - The mastercontainer orchestrates updates and backups
#
# CRITICAL: The nextcloud_aio_mastercontainer volume contains:
# - Backup encryption keys
# - Container orchestration state
# Never delete this volume without backing up keys first!

# First Run
# =========
# 1. Access https://localhost:8080 (self-signed cert warning expected)
# 2. Copy the initial password shown
# 3. Follow the setup wizard
# 4. Configure domain and optional containers
